/T (\(a\) The bar shall be straight and well knurled and grooved and shall conform to the following dimensions:  1. Total overall length not to exceed 2.2 m.  2. Distance between the collar faces is not to exceed 1.32 m or be less than 1.31 m.  3. Diameter of the bar is not to exceed 29 mm or be less than 28 mm.  4. Weight of the bar and collars are to be 25 kg.  5. Diameter of the sleeve not to exceed 52 mm or be less than 50 mm.  6.The bar shall have machined diameter markings spaced 81 cm apart. )
