/T (\(g\) All items mentioned previously under personal equipment shall be inspected. \(i\) Items such as watches, costume jewelry, mouthpieces, eye wear and feminine hygiene articles need not be inspected.  \(h\) Before attempting a world record the lifter will be inspected by the Technical Controller. If the lifter is found to be wearing or using any illegal item, other than that which may have inadvertently been passed by the referees, the lifter shall be disqualified from the competition.  \(i\) Referees and the Technical Controller for their particular bodyweight category must assemble five minutes prior to the start of the inspection of personal equipment. )
