/T (17\) At World Championships, or any other championships where attempts may be made on world records, only IPF category 1 or category 2 referees adjudicate. Each nation may nominate a maximum of three four referees to serve at the World Championships, plus 2 extra category 1 referees for Jury duty, if there is an insufficient number. All nominated referees attending a championship, must be available for at least two days. )
/E (17\) At World Championships, or any other championships where attempts may be made on world records, only IPF category 1 or category 2 referees adjudicate. Each nation may nominate a maximum of three four referees to serve at the World Championships, plus 2 extra category 1 referees for Jury duty, if there is an insufficient number. All nominated referees attending a championship, must be available for at least two days. )
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [6]
